
STRICT RESPONSE FORMAT:- JSON
- "options" key with value as dictionary.
- "answer" key with value as dictionary.
Example:- 
```json
{
  "options": {
    "A": "option A",
    "B": "option B",
    "C": "option C"
  },
  "answer": {
    "A": "{type_A}",
    "B": "{type_B}",
    "C": "{type_C}"
  }
}
```

**Important Notes:**
- Answer values depend on question type (Yes/No, True/False, Would Help/Would Not Help, etc.)
- Each option gets a dichotomous choice answer
- All statements must be answered correctly to receive credit